Subject: [PATCH] v1.35.0: fleet page rebuilt around a cluster wall, score
 reasons, Simulate fixes, one-line issues

- Cluster wall: one tile per cluster, grouped by org, coloured by its worst
  open issue, with Fix ready / Needs a decision.
- What holds the score down: the checks that cost the fleet score the most.
- Simulate fixes: redraws the wall, score and issues as they would be after
  the fixes the plugin already has. Nothing is sent anywhere.
- Issues are one line each until opened; Needs you now and Next 30 days
  share a card.
- vks-fleet mark, issue icons, and the unmodified Kubernetes icon from the
  CNCF artwork repository (see NOTICE).
- Fix: an issue's button could read "Go to Go to it".

New pure module src/fixes.ts with tests/fix-proposals.test.ts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
